{
    "folder": "S2mdf2RgOkLIkDnp",
    "name": "Steel Allomancy",
    "type": "power",
    "img": "systems/cosmere-rpg/assets/icons/mistborn/metal-powers/icon_A_steel.webp",
    "system": {
        "id": "steel-allomancy",
        "type": "metallic-art",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Steel Allomancy allows you to see blue lines extending from your center of mass to that of nearby metal objects. You can Steelpush those sources of metal, moving either you or the object away from the other (depending on which is bulkier). Because steel Allomancers can launch small metal objects at deadly speeds, many people call them Coinshots.</p>",
            "chat": "",
            "short": ""
        },
        "resources": {
            "uses": null,
            "charges": null,
            "ammo": null
        },
        "events": {},
        "relationships": {},
        "customSkill": true,
        "skill": "all",
        "talentTree": null,
        "primaryResource": "none",
        "__embedded": {
            "items": [
                {
                    "name": "Burn Steel",
                    "type": "action",
                    "_id": "QX2wHbTxyPNf0sEP",
                    "img": "systems/cosmere-rpg/assets/icons/mistborn/metal-powers/icon_A_steel_burn.webp",
                    "system": {
                        "id": "burn-steel",
                        "type": "metallic-arts",
                        "description": {
                            "value": "<p>While you have 1 Investiture or more, you can burn a small amount of steel without spending Investiture. Until the end of your next turn, you sense each source of metal within your Metallic Art range and learn its size, with the following limitations:</p><ul><li><p>You can’t use this power to sense aluminum.</p></li><li><p>Unless you have 6 ranks or more in <strong>Allomancy</strong>, you can’t sense Invested objects (like metalminds and Hemalurgic spikes) or objects that are at least partially embedded in a character’s body (like piercings).</p></li></ul><p>Before your steel burn ends, if you have 1 Investiture or more, you can maintain it for the same duration by using <span class=\"cosmere-icon\">0</span>.</p>",
                            "chat": "",
                            "short": ""
                        },
                        "activation": {
